    Bootstrap is a free and open-source front-end framework for designing websites and web applications. It is based on HTML, CSS and JavaScript and is widely used for creating responsive, mobile-first web applications. Bootstrap provides a set of pre-designed and pre-coded UI components, such as navigation bars, alert boxes, buttons, and more, which can be easily integrated into web projects to speed up development.
    -->
    <%- include('navdata.ejs'); %>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js" integrity="sha384-C6RzsynM9kWDrMNeT87bh95OGNyZPhcTNXj1NW7RuBCsyN/o0jlpcV8Qyq46cDfL" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
  </body>
